{"transcript":"pɒmɪˈdɒr","exists":true,"definitions":["Qizil yoki sariq rangli, yumaloq meva, ko'pincha sabzavot deb hisoblanadi va salatlarda, souslarda ishlatiladi.","Pomidor o'simligining yeyiladigan mevasi."],"examples":["Salatga pomidor qo'shing.","Pomidor sharbati juda foydali.","Bu pomidorlar juda shirin."],"lemma":"pomidor","lemmaPos":"noun","synonyms":["qizil meva","tomat"],"number":"singular","pluralForm":"pomidorlar","source":"pomidor"}